 "note": "Curvy, 11 platforms, 3 relays. The middle road is a serpent: out of the home it bends down (Curve_45) onto a switch platform, then up and down again (Curve_45 left, right) into the centre Forge, whose serpent decks are a drawbridge (retract). The switches send the road on along the serpent or down a Curve_45 to the bottom axis platform; the pockets climb to the top one over Curve_45 arches. Bridges: S / M / L, Curve_45.",
